sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant FE as Next.js /solve page
    participant API as FastAPI /api/v1/solve_v3_stream
    participant ORCH as superset_v2_pipeline/profile_resolver
    participant OAI as OpenAI (structured output)
    participant VER as verification_gate (SymPy)
    participant PLOT as plot_integration + safe_parser/plot_renderer
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant CHAT as Next.js /chat/[id]

    U->>FE: Click Solve
    FE->>API: POST solve_v3_stream (confirmed_text, tier, requested_mode, graph_mode, idempotency_key, trusted_context)
    API->>DB: Insert SolverOutputAttempt(request_id, attempt_id, status=pending)
    API->>ORCH: Resolve profile + prompts/schemas + policy
    ORCH->>DB: Load active bindings/prompts/schemas + system config
    API->>OAI: _call_llm_with_schema / solve_stream (messages + response_format json_schema)
    OAI-->>API: Structured JSON + usage(model/tokens/finish_reason)
    API->>VER: verify_solve_result(problem_text, result)
    VER-->>API: verification_meta (verified, method, candidates, checks_run)
    API->>PLOT: maybe_generate_plot + apply_graph_mode_override
    PLOT-->>API: visuals.plots / fallback / decision_reason
    API->>DB: Persist attempt + chat session/messages + runtime_meta
    API-->>FE: SSE meta/delta/telemetry/done(session_id, message_id)
    FE->>CHAT: router.push(/chat/{session_id})
    CHAT->>API: GET /sessions/{session_id}
    API-->>CHAT: Messages with structured_data.visuals + steps + verification
    CHAT-->>U: Render solution + graph
